flowchart TD
    A[User intent in UI] --> B[Generate idempotency key once]
    B --> C[Attach actor identity and correlation ID]
    C --> D{Processed command exists for actor, type, key}
    D -->|Yes| E[Return stored response]
    D -->|No| F[Validate owner, role, state and constraints]
    F --> G[Create aggregate state snapshot]
    G --> H[Write audit event and processed command]
    H --> I[Commit one database transaction]
    I --> J[Refresh owner scoped query model]

    G --> K[StylingSession]
    K --> L[Body contract snapshot]
    K --> M[Wardrobe revision snapshot]
    K --> N[Context snapshot]
    K --> O[Catalog and rule version hash]
    K --> P[Decision run and evidence]
    P --> Q[User candidate selection]
    Q --> R[Try-on run with truthful render status]
    R --> S[Feedback record]

    I --> T[Transactional outbox in P1]
    T --> U[Celery or reviewer notification]
    U --> V[ReviewTask OPEN]
    V --> W{Atomic claim}
    W -->|Conflict| X[Return current assignee]
    W -->|Claimed| Y[Reviewer evidence and checklist]
    Y --> Z{Decision}
    Z -->|Approve| AA[Activate revision or mark evaluation approved]
    Z -->|Reject| AB[Reject and retain evidence]
    Z -->|Rework| AC[Create rework path]
    AA --> AD[Audit event and UI refresh]
    AB --> AD
    AC --> AD
